       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.          TMTLSTAT.
       AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
       DATE-WRITTEN.        MARCH, 1982.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
      *SECURITY.
      *REMARKS. THIS IS THE MATERIAL STATUS INQUIRY PROGRAM.
      *
      *    IN SEPTEMBER OF 1981 THE FOLLOWING CHANGES WERE MADE:
      *      1.  CAPABILITY TO USE THE NEW REC-SEPARATOR WHICH CAN
      *          BE USED ON ALL CRT'S - ESPECIALLY THE 2626A.
      *          LOOK AT CTL-CAR IN WORKING-STORAGE.
      *          J.COFFMAN
      *    ON NOVEMBER 11, 1981 THE FOLLOWING CHANGES WERE MADE:
      *      2.  THE "CWHO" INTRINSIC WAS ADDED TO DETERMINE WHAT
      *          DATABASE THE PGM SHOULD BE POINTED AT.
      *          A.T.LEPERA.
      *    IN MARCH OF 1982, THIS PROGRAM WAS EXPANDED FROM A 1-
      *    SCREEN INQUIRY TO 5 SCREENS.  THIS IS FOR ADDED FIELDS
      *    AND SELF-DOCUMENTING FEATURES.  CIH.
      *
      *    ON JUNE 18, 1982, A TEST FOR A HOME GROUP OF "PLANT2"
      *    OR "PLANT3" WAS ADDED.  THIS WILL DIRECT THE INQUIRY
      *    TO THE CORRECT DATABASE AT THE AKRON MULTI-DATABASE
      *    FACILITY.
      *    CIH.
      *
      *         JUNE 1983
      *            1. CONVERTED PROGRAM TO VIEW.
      *            2. ADDED A BLANKET INQUIRY SUBROUTINE CALL
      *               FOR AKRON ONLY. THIS SCREEN BRING UP
      *               REQUIREMENT ORDERS IF 'f1' IS PRESSED
      *               ON THE FIRST INQUIRY SCREEN.
      *                 KURT MOVSESIAN.
      *
      *          AUGUST 1983
      *            1. ADDED LOGIC TO OPEN ALL DATA BASES IF THE
      *               PLANT IS AN AKRON PLT. THIS GIVES THEM
      *               COMPLETE INQUIRY INTO ANY DATA BASE IN
      *               AKRON (EXCEPT MIXCTR). PLANT 5 LOGIC WAS
      *               ALSO INCLUDED BUT COMMENTED OUT UNTIL STARTUP.
      *            2. ADDED AN INQUIRY SCREEN THAT SHOWS ALL PLTS.
      *               GIVING ONHANDS, UM, AND ONE REQUIREMENT ORDER
      *               IF THERE IS ONE. FROM THIS SCREEN THEY CAN GO
      *               INTO THE BASIC INQUIRY SCREEN.
      *            3. A PLANT INDICATOR WAS ADDED TO ALL SCREENS TO
      *               TELL THE USER WHICH PLANT THEIR IN.
      *                   KURT MOVSESIAN.
      *
      *    IN SEPT, 1983, CONVERTED THIS PROGRAM INTO A SUBPROGRAM,
      *    SO IT CAN BE CALLED FROM "TIRMAIN" - THE STORES PGM EXECUTIVE.
      *    WHEN RUNNING MTL STATUS AS STAND-ALONE, IT WILL BE CALLED
      *    BY A SHORT MAIN PGM CALLED "TMTSTEXC".  C HILLES.
      *
      *       OCT 18,1983
      *           1. TOOK OUT OPEN TO SPOOLFIL FOR SCREEN PRINTS THE
      *              PROGRAM NOW DOES NOT BLOW DOWN ON SPOOLKEY NOT
      *              FOUND. FOR SCREEN PRINTS ADDED CALLS TO THE
      *              SUBROUTINE 'TSCRPRNT' WHICH OPEN SPOOLFIL
      *              AND DOES ACTUAL SCREEN PRINTS.
      *                    KURT MOVSESIAN.
      *
      *       JAN 13, 1984
      *           OPEN UP LOGIC FOR PLANT5 IN THE OVERALL
      *           DATA BASE INQUIRY
      *               KURT MOVSESIAN.
      *
      *    ON JUNE 8, 1984, CHANGED THE VIEW FORM (NO PROGRAM CHANGES
      *    WERE MADE).  THE "AVG MONTHLY ISSUE" HEADING IS CHANGED
      *    (STR-MTH-FCST ITEM IN MSTORERM SEGMENT) TO "AVG MONTHY USAGE".
      *    THIS REFLECTS THE CHANGE MADE STARTING JULY 1 - FROM THIS
      *    TIME ON, THE STR-MTH-FCST FIELD WILL BE UPDATED FROM THE
      *    USAGE DATA ON THE HP, RATHER THAN TRANSMISSIONS FROM THE
      *    IBM MAINFRAME. CIH.
      *
      *    JUNE 1984.
      *      1. MADE NECESSARY CHANGES FOR REQUIREMENT ORDERS
      *         INQUIRY.
      *      2. ADDED PLANT9 INTO THE OVERALL DATA BASE INQUIRY
      *           KURT MOVSESIAN.
      *
      *    ON AUGUST 23, 1984, CHANGED THIS PROGRAM TO ALLOW AN INQUIRY
      *    BY AN "ALTERNATE KEY".  WHEN THE CORPORATE CODE IS ENTERED
      *    ON THE FIRST SCREEN, THIS PGM NOW CALLS THE SUBPROGRAM
      *    "TALTKEY", WHICH INQUIRES AGAINST A NEW DATASET "MALTKEY".
      *    "MALTKEY" HAS A 40-BYTE KEY ASSOCIATED WITH A CORP-CODE.
      *    "TALTKEY" CHECKS TO SEE IF AN ALTERNATE KEY WAS ENTERED
      *    (SUCH AS "ADAMAX" FOR 2610211), AND IF SO RETURNS THE
      *    ACTUAL CORPORATE CODE TO THIS PGM.  THE PROGRAM THEN CONTINUES
      *    ON AS NORMAL. FOR MULTIPLE DATABASE SITUATIONS AS IN AKRON,
      *    ONLY ALTERNATE KEYS IN THE "HOME" DATABASE WILL BE
      *    RECOGNIZED.   ALSO ADDED THE FORMS CACHE ABILITY TO THE
      *    PROGRAM BY CALLING THE SUBPROGRAM "TTERMTYP".  CIH.
      *
      *
      *    DEC. 10, 1984
      *     1. ADDED LOGIC TO SURPRESS MARKET COST IF THE USER IS NOT
      *        ONE OF THE FOLLOWING - 'PURCH', 'BUYER', 'MATCONT', OR
      *        'ACCTG'.
      *          KURT MOVSESIAN.
      *
      *    ON JANUARY 21, 1985, ADDED A CORPORATE CODE PARAMETER
      *    THE THE CALL OF THIS SUBPROGRAM.  THIS IS PRIMARILY SO THAT
      *    AN MMIS PROGRAM - WHICH INQUIRES ON ALL CORP-CODED PARTS
      *    IN A MACHINE SUBSYSTEM - MAY CALL THE INQUIRY, BUT PASS THE
      *    CORPORATE CODE THAT IS DESIRED TO BE INQUIRED ON.  THIS WAY
      *    THE USER CAN SELECT A CORPORATE CODE THAT ALREADY IS DISPLAYED
      *    ON THE MMIS INQUIRY, AND THEN SEE THE MATERIAL STATUS INQUIRY
      *    SCREEN, WITHOUT HAVING TO ENTER THE CORPORATE CODE AGAIN
      *    (ON THE CORP CODE ENTRY SCREEN OF THE MATERIAL STATUS
      *    INQUIRY).  IF THE PASSED CORPORATE CODE IS SPACES, THE
      *    CORPORATE CODE ENTRY SCREEN IS BROUGHT UP AS USUAL.
      *    THE FOLLOWING PROGRAMS CALL THIS INQUIRY, AND NOW HAVE AN
      *    ADDED "DUMMY" CORP CODE PARAMETER - TCORITM, TIRMAIN,
      *    TISSCRWS, TMTSTEXC, TRMCORR.  CIH.
      *
      *    ON APRIL 27, 1985, CHANGED THE PARAMETERS FOR THE CALL
      *    TO THE BLANKET CHECK PROGRAM "TCHKBLKT" AND THE BLANKET
      *    INQUIRY PROGRAM "TBLKTINQ".  THESE SUBPROGRAMS WERE
      *    CHANGED TO CALL THE "TBLOWUP" SUBROUTINE WITHIN THE
      *    SUBPROG, THEREFORE THE PARAMETERS FOR FATAL ERROR SWITCH
      *    AND BLOWUP MESSAGE WERE ELIMINATED.  CIH.
      *
      *    MAY 1, 1985;  ADDED TDATECHK ROUTINE AND COPYLIB. -B. WINTER.
      *
      *    MAY 7, 1985;  NO LONGER STRIPPING "A" OFF OF REQ NUMBER.
      *                     -B. WINTER.
      *
      *    ON JUNE 1, 1985, EXPANDED ALL USAGE FIELDS ON THE SCREEN
      *    FROM 8 DIGITS (WITH SIGN) TO 9 DIGITS, SO THAT USAGE WILL
      *    NOT BE TRUNCATED.  SOME STATIONERY CODES IN PLANT 1 AKRON
      *    WERE IN THE 10-MILLIONS USAGE, AND WERE BEING TRUNCATED.
      *    IN ORDER TO PUT ANY FORM FILE CHANGES FORM "VMTLSTAT"
      *    INTO ALL FORM FILES OF PROGRAMS THAT CALL THIS SUBPROGRAM,
      *    I CREATED THE JOB STREAM "FMTLSTAT.COMPILE".  CIH.
      *
      *    ON AUGUST 15, 1985,  ADDED HIGH-USAGE AREAS TO THE FMTLSTAT2
      *    SCREEN (MQ1-2).   DALE HOERLE.
      *
      *
      *   10/ 8/85  ADDED CALLS TO FINDJCW, NLAPPEND, CATOPEN, AND
      *             CATCLOSE IN ORDER TO ACCOMODATE THE NATIVE
      *             LANGUAGE SUPPORT FACILITY.  ADDED LINKAGES AND
      *             ALSO MADE THE CHANGE TO THE FORMFILE NAMES.
      *             CHANGED ALL REFERENCES OF TSCRPRNT TO TSCRPRT2,
      *             TDATECHK TO TDATECK2.
      *             THIS WAS TO INCORPORATE THE NATIVE LANGUAGE
      *             SUPPORT VERSIONS OF THESE SUBROUTINES.
      *                                         PD RAGLOW.
      *
      *  10/16/85   EXPANDED THE FULL DESCRIPTION FEATURE (SCREEN
      *             4) TO INCLUDE ANY 2ND LANGUAGE DESCRIPTION
      *             FROM DDESC2 AND MANUFACTURER INFORMATION FROM
      *             DMANPART AFTER THE DESCRIPTION FOUND IN DDESC.
      *             ALSO CONVERTED PROGRAM TO TBLOWUP.
      *                                         D.A. PLUM
      *
      *
      *    01/29/86.
      *      ADDED A CHECK FOR VIEW STATUS 160 AFTER EACH "VREADFIELDS"
      *      CALL.  THIS VIEW STATUS IS A TIMEOUT OF THE VIEW SCREEN,
      *      WHICH IS USED BY MMIS PROGRAMS CALLING THIS SUBPROGRAM.
      *      CIH.
      *
      *  04/01/86  REVISED THE FULL DESCRIPTION FUNCTION (SCREEN 4)
      *            TO DISPLAY THE MANUFACTURER INFORMATION FIRST,
      *            FOLLOWED BY THE PRIMARY DESCRIPTION (DDESC), AND
      *            FINALLY THE SECONDARY DESCRIPTION (DDESC2).  ALSO
      *            ADDED CALLS TO THE SUBPROGRAM CFINPTYP WHICH
      *            RETURNS MFR NUMBER TYPES SUCH AS P/N, CAT, DWG.
      *                                           D.A. PLUM
      *
      *    06/11/86.
      *       ADDED A CALL TO "CDESC" TO GET THE DESCRIPTION
      *       FOR SCREEN-2. (BASIC INQUIRY FIELDS).  THIS SUBPROGRAM
      *       WILL INCORPORATE THE NEW DMANPART ENTRIES.
      *       CIH.
      *
      *    06/26/86.
      *      FIXED BUG IN "REPAIRABLE ITEM" DISPLAY AND "REQUIREMENTS
      *      ORDER" DISPLAY.  THESE WERE NOT CLEARED OUT FOR EACH CODE,
      *      AND THEREFORE THE MESSAGE FROM THE PREVIOUS CODE WAS
      *      RETAINED.
      *      CIH.
      *
      *    08/5/86.
      *      ADDED PLANT4 AND MIXCTR INTO THE OVERALL DATA BASE
      *      INQUIRY.  REVAMPED SCREEN-1B IN ORDER TO ACCOMODATE THE
      *      INFORMATION ON PLANT4 AND THE MIXCTR.
      *                                  - ANNETTE KRAUSS.
      *
      *C   09/16/93  JEFF BUNGO   REQUEST 6425
      *C       ADDED "ONDOCK" FIELD TO BASIC INQUIRY SCREEN.
      *C       ON DOCK IS THOSE ITEMS RECEIVED BUT NOT YET STORED.
      *C
      *C   07APR1994  DAVE PLUM   REQUEST #6490
      *C       REMOVED ALL REFERENCES TO "C O P Y D B" TYPE COPYLIBS.
      *C
      *C   11AUG1994  DAVE PLUM   REQUEST #6524 (94-039)
      *C       ENHANCED THE "MORE DESCRIPTION SCREEN" TO INCLUDE
      *C       INDICATION OF WHICH MANUFACTURER(S) ARE "SELECTED".
      *C       THIS SELECTION VALUE IS COPYLIB FIELD MAN-PARTNO-SELECT.
      *C
      *C       ALSO REVISED ALL REFERENCES TO "C O P Y C S I S" TO
      *C       "COPYLIB".
      *C
      *C   12APR1996  CATHY YODER  REQUEST #96-014
      *C       ADDED "LAST BUYER" FIELD TO INQUIRY SCREEN.
      *C
      *C   06/10/96   JEFF BUNGO
      *C       EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C       RECOMPILE PROGRAM TO PICK UP NEW FILE FORMATS.
      *C
      *C   12/18/96   JEFF BUNGO   REQ #96-042
      *C       ALLOW THE INQUIRY OF LAST PO THROUGH FUNCTION KEY 5.
      *C
      *C   1/13/97    BILL ROXBURY REQ #95-012
      *C       ADDED TOTALS FOR RECEIPTS FROM NEW RECEIVING FILE.
      *C
      *C  11/25/97    JEFF BUNGO   REQ #97-017
      *C     ADD USAGE FIELDS FOR DIRECT DELIVERY.  DD USAGE
      *C     TO BE STORED IN ADDITIONAL FIELD AND TOTAL USAGE.
